    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Filing Your Spanish Income Tax Return as an Expat: Complete Guide</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">If you spend more than 183 days per year in Spain — or if your main economic interests are here — you're a Spanish tax resident and must file an annual income tax return (declaración de la renta). For many expats, this is their first encounter with the Spanish tax system. Here's what to expect.</p>
  </div>
